# forensics-lab local state. Nothing here is source.
#
# The compiled payload is a build product of lab/payload/d12payload.c. It is self-authored
# and reproducible with `lab/payload/build.bat`, but a binary does not belong in git, and
# the root .gitignore already excludes *.dll. Listed here so the reason is local to the lab
# rather than inherited by accident.
lab/payload/*.dll
lab/payload/*.obj
lab/payload/*.exp
lab/payload/*.lib
lab/payload/*.pdb
lab/payload/*.ilk
